  "purpose": "Sanitized examples for linking platform feedback to eval review, offline scoring review, issue intake candidates, and low-sensitive continuity hints. These fixtures are documentation and contract examples only; they do not implement feedback ingestion, scoring changes, issue creation, memory writes, facts writes, DB writes, or repair.",
